 Axios Pro Rata 
 
 
 
 
 By Dan Primack &middot; Aug 24, 2026 
 
 
 🎬 Situational awareness: California AG Rob Bonta reportedly has canceled today's planned meeting with Paramount Skydance CEO David Ellison, accusing Paramount of leaking details of a meeting last Friday.

 The pair had been expected to negotiate a settlement to the multi-state antitrust lawsuit that seeks to block Paramount's proposed takeover of Warner Bros. Discovery. Bonta may have asked Paramount to divest some cable channels, per the WSJ . But that would have been tricky, since Paramount is counting on cable cashflow to help pay down acquisition financing. 
 
